Fully renovated 2-bedroom apartment with 2 bathrooms, balcony and storage room, ready to move into, in Amadora.

The apartment comprises:

-Living room: 15.88 m²

-Dining area: 9.87 m²

-Kitchen: 11.06 m²

-Bedroom 1 (en-suite): 11.74 m²

-Bedroom 2 (walk-in closet): 12.33 m²

-En-suite bathroom: 2.77 m²

-Guest bathroom: 2.79 m²

-Entrance hall: 10.28 m²

-Balcony: 3.21 m²

-Storage room: 11.50 m²

Features:

-Equipped kitchen;

-Two full bathrooms;

-Air conditioning installed in the living room and in the en-suite bedroom;

-Double-glazed windows;

-Balcony;

-3rd floor (top floor of the building) with an open view;

-Excellent natural light (dual aspect, East/West).

Location:

Located in Largo Eugénio dos Santos, in Reboleira (parish of Venteira), the property benefits from a privileged and quiet location, close to all kinds of shops, essential services and public transport.

Nearby you will find:

-Reboleira Metro Station (Blue Line);

-Reboleira and Amadora train stations (Sintra Line);

-Supermarkets (Continente, Pingo Doce, Lidl);

-Pharmacies and the Venteira Health Centre;

-Hospital da Luz Lisboa (Amadora) and Hospital Amadora-Sintra;

-Schools and nurseries (EB1 Vasco Martins Rebolo, Escola Secundária D. João V);

-Parque Central da Amadora and green spaces;

-Cafés, pastry shops, restaurants and local shops;

-Bus services (Carris Metropolitana);

-Bank branches and public services;

-Quick access to the IC19, CRIL (A36) and A5.

The Reboleira / Amadora area continues to stand out for its proximity to central Lisbon, wide range of direct transport and excellent road access, making this property an excellent choice both as a home and as an investment with growth potential.

The property will be sold unfurnished, but with the equipped kitchen.

NEED BANK FINANCING?

